sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant JwtAuthGuard
    participant TenantGuard
    participant PermissionsGuard
    participant Handler
    participant Prisma as Prisma (tenant extension)

    Client->>JwtAuthGuard: Bearer access token
    JwtAuthGuard->>JwtAuthGuard: Verify JWT (iss/aud/secret)
    alt Public route
        JwtAuthGuard-->>Handler: Skip auth
    else Protected
        JwtAuthGuard->>TenantGuard: Continue (identity in CLS)
        TenantGuard->>Prisma: Load Session + User + Roles (unscoped lookup)
        TenantGuard->>TenantGuard: Check session org match, status, revocation, expiry
        TenantGuard->>TenantGuard: Re-resolve permissions from roles
        TenantGuard->>TenantGuard: Set TenantScope (org/user/session/roles/perms/branchIds/patientId)
        TenantGuard->>PermissionsGuard: Continue
        PermissionsGuard->>PermissionsGuard: Check @ApiEndpoint.permissions vs effective permissions
        alt Forbidden
            PermissionsGuard-->>Client: 403 FORBIDDEN
        else Allowed
            PermissionsGuard->>Handler: Call handler
            Handler->>Prisma: Query via tenantFor(org) / tenant client
            Prisma->>Prisma: Inject orgId filters for TENANT_MODELS
            Prisma-->>Handler: Org-scoped results
        end
    end
